ance Shader Parameters` were not reflecting when material properties were changing in `material_overlay`. There was a missing material signal handling for `material_overlay`.\r\n\r\nThere was also a related bug for the same fields, during assignment or removal of material, inspector wasn't refreshing automatically. Inspector is also now refreshed immediately when either material is set or cleared by calling `notify_property_list_changed()`, following the same paradigm as `TileSetAtlasSourceEditor::AtlasTileProxyObject::edit`.\r\n\r\nSignal hookup is handled through `GeometryInstance3D::_update_material_property_list_connection()` so shared or reassigned materials do not produce duplicate connections or an editor error stating signal to be already attached.\r\n\r\nFixes: #117404\r\n\r\nEdit: Removed unnecessary lambda.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNl